window.products.push({"id":308050,"name":"Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, Electric Pepper Grinder & Electric Salt Grinder with Adjustable Coarseness, Pepper Mill with LED Light, Automati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kMfG7e2RL._AC_SL1478_.jpg","description":"Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set -- With the electric pepper grinder automatic, you don’t have to grind by hand anymore. Press the button to start grinding, release the button to stop grinding. The automatic salt and pepper grinder is powered by 4 AAA alkaline batteries and and does not require constant charging. Automatic salt and pepper grinder set with Adjustable Coarseness -- Adjust the thickness of the spice by turning the rotary button on the bottom of the salt grinder. Rotate clockwise into fine particles and rotate counterclockwise to grind into coarse particles. Choose the thickness of the spices according to your needs. Salt and Pepper Grinder with Thoughtful Design -- Diameter: 2.16”, height: 70.8”, weight: 235g. The weight and shape of the salt grinder is designed to conform to the characteristics of the hand, making it easy to hold. The electric pepper grinder comes with a LED light which prevents excessive seasoning. Light on when grinding, light off when stopping. Pepper Mills Set with High-quality Materials -- The body of the salt and pepper grinder is made of stainless steel and ABS, which make the grinder anti-drop and anti-oxidation. The components inside the pepper grinder are made of ceramic, which is hard, wear-resistant and has a long life. The silo adopts a rotary transparent button for easy feeding and looking. Multifunctional Salt and Pepper Grinder Set Battery Operated -- One for salt and the other for pepper, no worry for mixing flavor. The electric grinder can be used for solid spices, such as Himalayan salt, sea salt, white and black pepper and black sesame. The silo of the pepper grinder refillable can hold 2.3 ounces of spices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kMfG7e2RL._AC_SL1478_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ISUMER","source_asin":"B0BYS7XVKB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-308050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYS7XVKB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYS7XVKB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
