window.products.push({"id":308072,"name":"Wallace 53 pc Riverbed Flatware Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41K913JGADL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Riverbed has a beautiful hammered design on each handle. The set is a service for 8 and has 8 dinner knives, dinner forks, salad forks, teaspoons and dinner spoons. There is a bonus of 8 teaspoons. The hostess set includes a serving spoon, cold meat fork, a pierced serving spoon, a butter knife, and a sugar spoon. Amazon.com Created by Wallace, Riverbed flatware has a flowing design that balances polish with organic detailing. Crafted from premium 18/10 stainless steel, the pattern features arched handles with square ends and beautifully hammered surfaces. The working ends are broad and sleek, and the knives have flat handles. The overall look of Riverbed is modern yet warm, with a lovely play between the mirror finish and the rippled texture. For the sake of versatility, Riverbed's sizing is transitional-more generous than everyday flatware and not as large as European designs. A thorough collection, this 53-piece Riverbed set includes eight place settings, each with two salad forks, a dinner fork, a dinner knife, a dinner spoon, and a teaspoon. The accompanying serving set includes a tablespoon, a pierced tablespoon, a cold meat fork, a sugar spoon, and a butter knife. Additional serving pieces are also available, and the pattern is safe in the dishwasher for easy cleanup. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 8 place settings, 5 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: dinner fork; 2 salad forks; soup spoon; knife; teaspoon. Service set consists of: butter knife; sugar spoon; serving fork; pierced serving spoon; serving spoon. 53 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41K913JGADL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallace","source_asin":"B000I5M5KK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-308072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000I5M5KK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000I5M5KK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
