window.products.push({"id":308165,"name":"Handstand Kids 17-Piece Junior Baking Set with Recipes for Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F0N8bWtxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Here's the perfect set for every child that is ready to explore the fun of real baking - the Junior Baker Set from Handstand Kids ! The perfect addition to your \"kitchen classroom\", this complete 17-piece set includes everything you need to bake all of your favorites with your children. Baking utensils included in the set are sized to be easily used by both older children and adults and each piece is sturdy enough to be of regular use in your kitchen. Set includes:1 spatula, 1 pastry brush, 1 mixing spoon, 1 silicone loaf pan, 6 silicone baking cups, 1 rolling pin, 1 whisk, and 5 recipe cards. Match the set with aprons from Handstand Kids for even more fun! Handstand Kids cookbooks and accessories are the result of the founder's deep desire to introduce children to international foods in a fun and hands-on way. Handstand Kids cookbooks are the perfect recipe for kids to learn about the people, places and language of a new country while also learning to create their own versions of traditional international dishes. Handstand Kids kitchen accessories include true kitchen quality tools that are sized just right for children as well as aprons for everyone who wants a look that's as beautiful as the dishes they are creating! Join Handstand Kids in bringing international flare mixed with the traditional comforts of home to your children!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F0N8bWtxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handstand Kids","source_asin":"B07K1PNQTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-308165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K1PNQTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K1PNQTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
