window.products.push({"id":308459,"name":"12 in Wreath-Hangers for Front Door,Non-Scratch-Wreath-Door-Hanger,2 Pack Durable Wreath Hanger Hook for Fall Christmas Easter Valentines Decorations,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819hYUL+QbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade Wreath Hangers for Front Door: The 2 pack door hangers are made of high-quality plastic, durable and flexible, not easy to deform and break and can be used year after year. Compared with metal wreath hanger, the plastic one never leave stains on the door, fade and scratch the door. Large loading capacity can even up to 10lb, you can hang large wreath or other home decor by using this door hook, and increased the length of the hook part to make it easier to hang things and avoid falling Multi-Application Door Wreath Hanger: The wreath hook can be used to hang various door decorations through out the year, no just for Christmas wreaths, not limited to one holiday. All season wreaths or decorations are ok, like Fall Halloween Christmas Easter Valentines decorations, front door décor, Welcome Sign for front door etc. Of course, our over the door wreath hanger are also good for daily life to hanging bags, clothes, hats, umbrella, keys or Christmas stockings and more Damage-free Door Hanger Hook: Over the door hanger have round and smooth edges, not only no damage to door and doorframe, but also don’t hurt your fingers. Meanwhile, the door reef wreath hanger designed for installation free, no need tools(no adhesive, no drill, no screws), just hang it over the door to proper place, then put wreaths on is ok. Simple and easy to use, little kids can also enjoy this, decorating the home together with parents Fits for Most Doors Over the Door Hooks: The wreath hangers over the door part of wide is 2.05in, making the wreath holder wide enough for most standard doors under 1.8in. And our front door hanger for interior and exterior is work well for different door, such as glass door, metal door, wooden door, storm door and so on. Its durable features make the door hook can be used year after year in the wind and rain, and it won't fade as the metal hook Ease to Close Door Wreath Door Hanger: The wreath hook is 12 in length, 1.02 in width, and the part of door holder over the door just 0.078in thickness, which thin enough to allow the door to close and open well. The door hooks for hanging are sturdy enough for a large wreath up to 10 lbs, and its length will avoid covering the door hole, very practical","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819hYUL+QbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UMIHHONZ","source_asin":"B0BL6N5RGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-308459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL6N5RGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL6N5RGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
