window.products.push({"id":308763,"name":"Saffron Marigold – Dreams of India: Mystic Amethyst – Purple and Gold Sari Inspired Hand Printed – Sheer Cotton Voile Kitchen Curtain Panel – Rod Pock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GOyunKmVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our dreamy, translucent semi-sheer cotton voile kitchen curtains are a delightful addition to any kitchen. With the sun delicately filtering in through the curtains you will enjoy privacy without having to sacrifice a well lit kitchen. The kitchen is the heart of every home where several hours are lovingly devoted to preparing wholesome meals… enhance your time there with the impeccable workmanship of these handcrafted kitchen curtains that will transform your kitchen from mundane to exquisitely enchanting. Each curtain is 44 inches wide and 24 inches long and is printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton voile and is exquisitely finished.Each piece is handcrafted using intricately hand carved wooden blocks and is an original work of art distinguished by the work of the artisan, the particular lot of dye, and even varying weather conditions. Tonal variations are inherent to the block printing process and enhance the individuality, character and uniqueness of each creation Inspiration for Dreams of India: The Dreams of India collection is inspired by the timeless, ubiquitous, sari that holds within its bountiful folds the traditions, secrets and mysteries of the art of female adornment. Using hand block printing with gold paste overlay, we have tried to recreate the look of India's resplendent Benarasi silk saris with their myriad hues and skillfully woven shimmering gold zari motifs and borders.  The Mystic Amethyst, in an intriguing deep purple, is one of the seven jewel toned hues in the sari inspired Dreams of India collection. Reflecting the deep mystical purple depths of true Amethyst, it consists of lustrous gold orbs that lie delicately patterned across a purple plum ground.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GOyunKmVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B0BWLC8TFX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-308763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWLC8TFX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWLC8TFX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
