window.products.push({"id":308855,"name":"Bamboo Steamer Set - Includes Two 10 Inch Wooden Baskets, Chopsticks, Tongs and Cloth Liners - Steam and Cook Fish, Dumplings and Vegetables - For Ste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kSYimWOEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for an authentic bamboo steamer set for your delicious and healthy steamed recipes? There's a reason why cooking using a bamboo steamer has existed for thousands of years. Steaming is a much gentler process that helps retain the fresh taste and nutrients of your ingredients. Steamed food still retains their natural flavor, texture, and appetizing color. You can't cook authentic Asian dishes without a good set of bamboo steamers. High-quality baskets combine the art and science of this traditional way of cooking—and we've put together the perfect set you can use for many meals to come. Cook your favorite steamed dishes with our Bamboo Steamer Set! Each bamboo steamer is made from high-quality and sustainable bamboo. They're crafted with a tight-weave design to prevent excess loss of steam. The baskets measure 10 inches each, allowing you to cook more batches of your favorite dim sum meals in one go. Impress guests with delicious and authentic Chinese, Japanese, and Korean steamed dishes. Use the chopsticks and tongs to move delicate dumplings onto your plate. The cloth liners will do a fine job in wiping the bamboo steamer clean. We've included proper care instructions in this listing. Can't make a decision? Here are more features that will make you fall in love with our bamboo steamer: ✅ All parts of the steamer are made from bamboo ✅ Won't give your food or ingredients an unpleasant odor or taste ✅ Looks attractive in your kitchen. Now's your chance to whip up mouth-watering steamed dishes! Add this Bamboo Steamer Set to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kSYimWOEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08H2G3BCV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-308855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H2G3BCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H2G3BCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
