window.products.push({"id":308948,"name":"CHILL·TEK Blanket to My Mom,Thanks for Being My Mom Flannel Fleece Blanket Super Soft Bed Throw Blanket Warm Cosy Velvet Blanket Lightweight Sofa Blan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l2yD-HV4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THOUGHTFUL WORDS - To My Mom, I am forever grateful for all that you are and who you have taught me to be. You are beautiful and soft around the edges but you have the strength of a steel. I hope someday to become at least half the person you are. Thank you for the unconditional love and support. I love you, mom, more than you will even know. BEST GIFT FOR MOM - This Gift Blankets is designed for thoughtful caring personal gift for Mom from Daughter. When Mother's Day, Christmas, Birthday this meaningful blanket could be a perfect gift for your Mom. You can telling her how much do you love. This blanket gift is specially designed for expressing love between mom and daughter. It would also make the best mom gift for any festival. ALL SEASONS - Mom Fleece Blanket is made of lightweight and warm enough microfiber material, super soft, smooth and comfortable to use in Spring, Summer, Autumn and Winter. The breathable fabrics makes you feel cozy without being smothered. Snuggle up on the couch with our luxurious cozy blankets, like a warm hug, this blanket will comfort and ease you into peaceful relaxation. REVERSIBLE & VERSATILE: Throws for Mom perfect for indoor and outdoor use to provide consecutive warmer in chilly weather. Ultra-comfortable, cozy, and ultra-plush warm Fleece Throws offer an elegant upscale look. Wraps this Comfy Throw Blanket over a Couch, Sofa, Chair or across the end of beds to add extra color and texture to your living room or bed room. SIZES - Plush Throw Blanket for Mom has 3 generous sizes to choose from. Throw size measures 40 by 50 inches, it is a nice size for your baby, dog or keeping your legs warm. Twin size measures 50 by 60 inches, suitable for watching TV, relaxing in the car as a shawl, or napping as a blanket. Queen size measures 60 by 80 inches, perfect for snuggling in bed or on the sofa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l2yD-HV4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHILL·TEK","source_asin":"B09SL1BNQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-308948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SL1BNQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SL1BNQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
