window.products.push({"id":308972,"name":"12 Pieces Satin Table Runner Long Wedding Table Runner Bright and Smooth Silk Fabric Table Runner for Wedding Banquet Reception Birthday Party Decorat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616a13bX79L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Include: you will get 12 pieces of 12x72inch / 30x180cm satin table runner in red color, long enough to fit rectangle table and round tables, can also be spliced together for long tables. Enough quantity for you to decorate your party or rooms. They are perfect for weddings, bridal shower, birthdays, catered presentations, banquets, buffet tables and more. Exquisite Workmanship: the wedding satin table runner is made of polyester satin, which has a smooth appearance and a natural drooping feeling, not easy to fade or shrink, seamless integrated design makes your decoration look elegant, which can meet your long-term using needs to protect your dining table. Seamless Design: this rectangle party table runner adopts one-piece simple design, all sides over-locked with the clean look, reduce wear and stretch. all edges of the table trim are locked with color-matched thread. straight and tight stitching for perfectly neat seams. luxurious feel and delicate satin luster create sublime elegance. Suitable for Various Occasions: the satin table runner is also used as chair cover sashes, decorative wraps or floral arrangement, perfect for a birthday party, baby shower, wedding, anniversary, picnic, kitchen, Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, Father’s Day, Mother’s Day, indoor and outdoor events, catering or any other party decorations. It is also a great gift for your friends who always like holding parties! Easy to Care: Due to long-distance transportation, the table runner you received may be slightly wrinkled, it is recommended that you can iron it before using it for better results, you can spray the table runner with a bottle until it is damped, then set the table runner flat onto an ironing board ,cover the largest wrinkles with a thin towel, set the iron to the lowest heat and heat it up, then press the iron against the towel to gently smooth out the runner's worst wrinkles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616a13bX79L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fivenl","source_asin":"B09KBB3D8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-308972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KBB3D8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KBB3D8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
